stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> RECON
    
    RECON --> HYPOTHESIZE: transition_phase
    RECON --> RECON: more recon needed
    
    HYPOTHESIZE --> TEST: transition_phase
    HYPOTHESIZE --> RECON: need more info
    
    TEST --> REFLECT: transition_phase
    TEST --> TEST: more testing
    
    REFLECT --> RECON: new attack surface
    REFLECT --> HYPOTHESIZE: new hypothesis
    REFLECT --> TEST: verify finding
    REFLECT --> [*]: finish_task
    
    note right of RECON
        Gather information
        Map attack surfaces
        Generate target manifest
    end note
    
    note right of TEST
        Can use branch_to_subtasks
        for parallel hypothesis testing
    end note
    
    note right of REFLECT
        Analyze results
        Plan next cycle
        May pause for user input
    end note